<title>ITALY: CYCLING-ITALY'S MANZONI WINS EIGHTH GIRO STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ITALY'S MANZONI WINS EIGHTH GIRO STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>CAVA DEI TIRRENI, Italy 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Mario Manzoni won the 203-km eighth stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race on Saturday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Fellow Italian Stefano Giraldi was second and his compatriot Maurizio Molinari was third.</p>
<p>Russia's Pavel Tonkov kept the overall lead.</p>
